  triage:title "BB6-005 residual: task close's TaskNotCounterparty tests assert only the error-string substring, not the typed AtmErrorCode" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB6-QA-CLI-FIX round 2 (PR #1465 comment, 2026-09-13T01:28:29Z, BB6-QA2-001, independently confirmed), verdict FAIL. BB6-005 asked for TaskStart/TaskClose to raise structured AtmErrorCode::TaskNotFound instead of anyhow string errors. Task start now correctly covers both AtmErrorCode paths, and task close's TaskNotFound path is fixed -- but task close's TaskNotCounterparty path (2 tests) still only asserts the error-string substring, not the typed code. The underlying code itself is already correct end-to-end; only the test coverage is missing. Filed as its own canonical id per fenix's instruction, correlated to BB6-005 rather than folded into it." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
