  triage:deferredNote "Fix: update task close's 2 TaskNotCounterparty tests to assert the typed AtmErrorCode rather than only the rendered error-string substring, matching the pattern already used for TaskNotFound. Dispatched to arch-ctm as BB6-FIX-CLI-QA2-1789281000, branch fix/bb6-cli-qa2 cut from his final runtime head (fix/bb6-runtime-qa1 @ b3e01cd7d), queued behind his runtime close (test-only, CLI crate). fix/bb6-cli-qa2 frozen at 7bb8f4a49 (merge of frozen R6 f23d87928); arch-ctm's close reported gates green. No per-layer QA -- the landing-head QA verifies this. Fixed-pending-QA at 7bb8f4a49." ;
